  "title": "Пассив: Past Simple",
  "theory": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "**was/were + третья форма** — что было сделано в прошлом: The lighthouse **was built** in 1890. My bike **was stolen** yesterday."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "head": [
        "Актив",
        "Пассив"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "Someone stole my wallet.",
            "My wallet was stolen."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "They built the bridge in 1900.",
            "The bridge was built in 1900."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "The storm destroyed the houses.",
            "The houses were destroyed by the storm."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "tip",
      "md": "Вопрос — was/were вперёд: **When was** the city **built**? Отрицание: It **wasn't found**."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
